{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1000_p", "source_sha256": "11674ecabbf98bceb3baf1bbf42e6d1bd33e3717fefc73186d59c7cdff5cfcf2", "ja": "（打ち合わせを終え、劇場に戻ってくると、\n机の上に手紙が置かれていた。差出人は……翼？）", "zh": "（结束商谈回到剧场后，发现桌上放着一封信。寄信人是……翼？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1001_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1002_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4af07c2c5e5bc301eacf0300f869f40c816746d91c6ab303ac08a4b14a3e0b52", "ja": "あ、{$P$}さん！\nおかえりなさい。お手紙、もう読んでくれました？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！\n欢迎回来。信，你已经读过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4b7a29b2a7200ff4975cf25d80e48a0a8d9c2141d0f0a498a3e96c3060605cb4", "ja": "ゴメン、戻ってきたばかりで。これから読むよ。\nでも、急に手紙なんてどうしたんだ？", "zh": "抱歉，我才刚回来。现在就看。\n不过，你怎么突然寄信来了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "45d71fce6e9e8d5a04052a17dff07e027ba739da906d62cc0a809707329b4c61", "ja": "えへへ、たまにはいいかなって。ほら、この前\n花札がテーマのPVを撮ったじゃないですか。", "zh": "嘿嘿，我想着偶尔这样也不错嘛。对了，我们之前不是拍过以花牌为主题的PV吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3651d68ffb4d821ff82bd7795a7c85d51dbb2ea5b5bb1b491bcaf794202a844c", "ja": "その時、教えてもらったんです。\n昔の人はお手紙で、気持ちを伝えてたって！", "zh": "就是那时候，我听别人说了。\n原来以前的人会通过书信传达自己的心意！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1006_p", "source_sha256": "2b450155a9445570e9d35bb4c028a4e4636e681a5802760aff8f088cd1a1d2f9", "ja": "それで手紙か。普段は、電話やメールで連絡したり\nしてるから、新鮮に感じるな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才写信啊。平时都是打电话或发邮件联系，感觉还挺新鲜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "08cc7b5ab619c2179308f3b97900227e79f2827a72e8cd48ba03b7f8335277cc", "ja": "ですよねー！　いつも言ってることを、\n改めて手紙にするとか。なんか不思議な感じ。", "zh": "就是说嘛！把平时说的话重新写成信，感觉还真有点不可思议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5a908c512e15608056d7c34e1259577a46147ac86501294c74d2caa995b9ee8d", "ja": "でもでも、頑張って書いたんです。わたしの想いが\nこもったお手紙、ちゃんと読んで下さいね♪", "zh": "但是但是，我可是努力写出来的。请一定要好好读读这封饱含我心意的信哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1009_p", "source_sha256": "976f2d405425d7c6171de864e789363b8e42f0ac108768994d2e8cf24e33663c", "ja": "大切に読ませてもらうよ。ちなみに、いつも言ってる\nことって……？　仕事の希望とか？", "zh": "我会好好细读的。顺便问一下，你说的“平时一直挂在\n嘴边的话”是……？对工作的要求之类的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "8f9ce047696ff19d4508013906d5601a1489eaeb32beb0b0a3c4eaa08c94aefc", "ja": "それは～……えへへ、恋文でーす♪", "zh": "那个嘛——……嘿嘿，是情书♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1011_p", "source_sha256": "c533fe6feac659e83e6d96b9d6a2a130b2767cdd60924f8676e76e0a1c11c28c", "ja": "……ん？　恋文？", "zh": "……嗯？情书？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4fc4a5ae28a71ccd411f272ecb2ec2b3c706ff0be109b9af7559b62d128595f5", "ja": "はい！　「大好き」って、いつも伝えてるけど……\n{$P$}さん、ちゃんと聞いてないし。", "zh": "对！虽然我总是在说“最喜欢你”……  \n可{$P$}先生根本没好好听嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1013_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5b27858deb2f576ee687b5df4a6321a34a7bf9e0e450d847c07f1ed06532ec9e", "ja": "こうやって、手書きの手紙でアピールしたら、\n印象に残るかな～って♪", "zh": "像这样用亲笔写的信来表达心意，说不定会让人印象深刻呢～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1014_p", "source_sha256": "0a4a9ae38d498b31017fd0a59565be8311a3af81e81a0e20433853c76277e278", "ja": "そ、そうか。……うん。\nこの手紙は、ありがたく頂戴するよ！", "zh": "是、是这样啊。……嗯。\n这封信我就心怀感激地收下了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a709b6415ecdf1cae4ed46217a3a9db8676fea94e365da498fd81e3adbcc8e87", "ja": "はい！　あ、それと……読み終わったら、\nちゃんと返事もお願いしますね～。", "zh": "好的！啊，还有……读完之后，\n也请一定要好好回信哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "a12ffa615b1ff76300aa4a866681effa15399b309f81fb6b0c8d50a8da66a6ba", "ja": "わたし、待ってますから！　\n楽しみだな～、{$P$}さんのお手紙♪", "zh": "我会等着您的！  \n好期待啊～，{$P$}先生的信♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0633_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0633_1017_p", "source_sha256": "330a4b7d0bb2a24a19ec67fe5f8a564b38dd2167e71a4f372a5621e32e33900b", "ja": "（その後、ゆっくり手紙を読んだ。翼への返事は……\nアイドルとしての魅力を、じっくり書いて送るか！）", "zh": "（之后，我慢慢读完了信。给翼的回信嘛……就把她作为偶像的魅力仔细写下来寄给她吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
